{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","顿里尔"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名威严的坦克，能够制定全场角色都需要遵守的秩序。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","吾将带着胜利之音归来。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嚯，养精蓄锐！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","聆听……旭日之音！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","吾要休息。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","不必膜拜。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","是你，召唤了吾？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让尔等见识一下。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","无论何事，吾将助你！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","直视吾。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","吾的耳朵，也为之欢悦。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","也算心意，放下吧。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","不要糟蹋吾的信任！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不必害怕，直视吾"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","美妙的乐章，会飘扬在夜空之上"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","在饮食上，吾不贪多"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","又到了隆冬节啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","美妙的乐章，会飘扬在夜空之上"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","多准备些礼物吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","多么热烈的交响曲"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我也去奏响钟声吧"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","很少有人敢直视顿里尔的眼睛，他不怒自威的气势让人畏惧。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔身边常围绕着为了得到他的青睐而竞相表现的人，谁都想成为那个有资格得到他教诲的宠儿。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔梳胡子是个大工程，要准备好香油和松膏，要把胡子有序分成几缕并固定好，要细致地修剪……他不吝惜花在这上面的时间，强者也需偶尔的消遣。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔相当厌恶任何把功夫下在诡辩上的人。因此没有人敢在他面前搬弄口舌是非，弄虚作假。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔厌恶不知所云的靡靡之音，他认为，如果乐章不浩大壮阔，还有何奏响的必要？"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","在战场上，顿里尔的钟声宛若千军万马呼啸而过，令敌人闻风丧胆。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔不屑欺瞒和矫饰，矫饰是弱者的特权。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔无法容忍乐章里存在不和谐的音律，没法细心地对待音符的人，配不上执掌的乐器。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔相信万事万物都如同乐章一样，有其音律。凡是违背音律行事的人，终将自取灭亡。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","顿里尔克制享乐，从不放纵欲望。他认为“强者应该掌控欲望，而不是被欲望掌控”。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","老朋友，这么长时间没见，你没有变啊，依然如此……无趣。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415039.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","不必害怕，直视吾"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415318.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","在饮食上，吾不贪多"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415319.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","又到了隆冬节啊"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415465.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","多准备些礼物吧"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415466.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","多么热烈的交响曲"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415643.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","顿里尔"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","我也去奏响钟声吧"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415644.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","顿里尔"]]}